@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_JWT
@contentType = application/json

### Donate to a campaign
POST {{baseUrl}}/donations/campaign/REPLACE_CAMPAIGN_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "amount": 25,
  "message": "Great initiative!",
  "cardNumber": "4242424242424242",
  "cardHolder": "Test User",
  "expiryDate": "12/30",
  "cvv": "123"
}

### My donations
GET {{baseUrl}}/donations/my?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Create PayPal order
POST {{baseUrl}}/donations/campaign/REPLACE_CAMPAIGN_ID/paypal/create-order
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "amount": 25,
  "message": "Donated via PayPal"
}

### Capture PayPal order (after PayPal redirect token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/donations/campaign/REPLACE_CAMPAIGN_ID/paypal/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": "REPLACE_PAYPAL_ORDER_ID",
  "message": "Donated via PayPal"
}

### PayPal webhook (signature headers required in real request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/donations/paypal/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
paypal-transmission-id: REPLACE
paypal-transmission-time: REPLACE
paypal-transmission-sig: REPLACE
paypal-auth-algo: SHA256withRSA
paypal-cert-url: REPLACE

{
  "id": "WH-TEST",
  "event_type": "PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED",
  "resource": {}
}
